WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
That's a massage machine. Watch it. Today I'll teach you how to operate it.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,540
It's so beautiful. It's as red as fire.

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,540
Brother Tong, how much can I sell this red piece for?

4
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,940
In the afternoon, a top boss came to bid on the spot.

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,460
You will know then

6
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:13,570
Now tell you the lowest price

7
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:16,210
I have to spread your fat body over my body.

8
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,120
Brother Tong, these are all what you won from gambling yesterday.

9
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,480
Your gambling skills are amazing

10
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,200
Luo Pang, the real origin of jade wool

11
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,480
Don't ask me any more questions from now on

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,240
Don't even make random guesses outside.

13
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:29,800
This is a trade secret

14
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,500
It’s also the foundation of our future company. Brother Tong, don’t worry.

15
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,060
I, Fatty, have the strictest mouth

16
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,460
Guaranteed to rot in the stomach

17
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,300
Okay, these are half-blind ingredients. The meat is evenly distributed, so you don’t have to worry about cutting it.

18
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,140
Just follow the drawn lines and carefully peel off the video.

19
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,060
Leave it to me with a monthly salary of 100,000

20
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,500
I will definitely do this job for you beautifully. You can do it slowly.

21
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:49,060
Peel off all the fat and crispy meat. I'll go up and rest for a while.

22
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,340
You do whatever you want, I can handle it by myself

23
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,300
There is a top joke at home
